   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Find the federal income tax owed by a person filing single who has a taxable income of $114,750. Use the table below to determine the taxes.\n<table class=\"unnumbered\" summary=\".\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Bracket</th>\n<th>Lower Income Limit</th>\n<th>Upper Income Limit</th>\n<th>Tax Rate</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>$10,275</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>$10,276</td>\n<td>$41,775</td>\n<td>12%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>$41,776</td>\n<td>$89,075</td>\n<td>22%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>$89,076</td>\n<td>$170,050</td>\n<td>24%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>$170,051</td>\n<td>$215,950</td>\n<td>32%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>$215,951</td>\n<td>$539,900</td>\n<td>35%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>$539,901</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>37%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
